# field-arrows (h8-points-field): ArrowUp twice in P's x field — the
# nudge writes p live (debounced) with the text reformatted. Behaviour: the
# field "2.02", the URL "p=2.02" past the debounce.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key ArrowUp
wait 100
key ArrowUp
wait 400
shot field-arrows
